  .job-card
        h3 🍗🛵Rocket Now Food delivery⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️
        p This is a newly launched and currently popular food delivery service in Japan. Once you receive an order from a customer, you go to the restaurant, pick up the items, and deliver them to the customer’s home.
        .red [Normally, foreign nationals cannot work for Rocket Now, but only when applying through our company, you can exceptionally work for them.]
        .row 
         .col-sm-6
          p
           strong Unit Price:
         .col-sm-6
           | 500 yen per item | The basic rate is 4 deliveries per hour
        .row 
         .col-sm-6
          p
          strong Rewards:
         .col-sm-6
          .red Day 1–3: 500 yen × 2.5 deliveries per hour × 9h = 11,250 yen
          .red Day 4–7: 500 yen × 3 deliveries per hour × 9h = 13,500 yen (Monthly 337,500 yen)
          .red Day 7 onward: 500 yen × 4 deliveries per hour × 9h = 18,000 yen (Monthly 450,000 yen)
        .row 
         .col-sm-6
          p
          strong Working Hours:
         .col-sm-6
          | [A] 11:00–16:00 / [B] 17:00–21:00
          br/
          | *You may work only A or only B
        .row
         .col-sm-6
          p
          strong Standard Working Days:
         .col-sm-6
          | 25 days per month
          br/
          | *Part-time work is also available.
        .row 
         .col-sm-6
          p
           strong Contract Type:
         .col-sm-6
           | Outsourcing contract (Gyomu Itaku)
           br/
           | No social insurance coverage.
        .row 
         .col-sm-6
          p
          strong Work Location:
         .col-sm-6
          | Tokyo, Kanagawa, Chiba, Saitama, Nagoya, Osaka, Kyoto, Kobe, Fukuoka, Sendai, Sapporo
        .row 
         .col-sm-6
          p
         .col-sm-6
           strong Eligible Visas:
           | Permanent Resident, Long-term Resident, Spouse Visa (and other unrestricted visas)
        .row 
         .col-sm-6
          p
          strong Vehicle & Gasoline:
         .col-sm-6
          | Rental motorized scooters provided (bicycle work negotiable)
          br/
          .red A gasoline subsidy of 3,000 yen is provided for full-time work
          | *Bicycle work is possible, but the unit price will be lower.
        .row 
         .col-sm-6
          p
          strong Japanese Language Level:
         .col-sm-6
          | Basic conversational ability is sufficient (no reading or writing required)
        .row 
         .col-sm-6
          p
           strong Others:
         .col-sm-6
           | ・Scooter rental fees and miscellaneous expenses will be deducted from your pay.
           br/
           | ・In regional areas, the unit price or delivery volume may be lower than stated.
           br/
           | ・You may work outside 11:00–16:00 / 17:00–21:00, but the reward will be 400 yen per delivery.
        .row 
         .col-sm-6
          p
           strong Caution:
         .col-sm-6
           | ・Salary reductions may occur due to misdeliveries, refusing orders during working hours, absence from the designated area, or missing scheduled shifts.
           br/
           | ・If rules are violated, shifts will be canceled and vehicle subsidies will be suspended.
           br/
           | ・The standard delivery volume is 4 deliveries per hour, but this may be lower in regional areas.
           br
           | ・Working outside 11:00–16:00 / 17:00–21:00 is possible, but the reward will be 400 yen per delivery.
           br/
           | ・Bicycle work is allowed, but reward conditions differ.

